# ALLOWLIST for the devcontainer build context (BuildKit reads
# <Dockerfile>.dockerignore in preference to a root .dockerignore).
#
# Everything is excluded, then exactly what the stages read is re-admitted:
# the toolchain's inputs (every module's go.mod/go.sum and the tool installer
# with its pins), and for the integration stage the Go sources of the root
# module's api/proto, cmd, pkg and internal trees and of the integration
# suite. Each stage COPYs its own part by name. Neither image can carry .git,
# a credentials file, build output or a coverage profile — whatever lands in
# the checkout tomorrow, it is excluded until someone admits it here on
# purpose.
*
!go.mod
!go.sum
!backup/go.mod
!backup/go.sum
!api/sdks/go/go.mod
!api/sdks/go/go.sum
!examples/encryption/go.mod
!examples/encryption/go.sum
!scripts/tool-pins.sh
!scripts/install-tools.sh
!api/proto/**/*.go
!cmd/**/*.go
!cmd/**/*.h
!pkg/**/*.go
!internal/**/*.go
!test/integration/**/*.go
